; energy_overflow: a coefficient at the i64 lower bound against the spin
; sample's default -1 produces a product outside the range.
;
; linear = [i64::MIN], sample = [-1] => i64::MIN * -1 is not representable.
; ENERGY must raise rather than wrap.

PUSH 1
SQMX r0
PUSH 0
PUSH -9223372036854775808
SETLINE r0

PUSH 1
SSMX r1

ENERGY r0 r1
HALT
